  m_text: "If you use a Credit Card:\L\nPay off your balance each month to\Lavoid
    paying interest.\L\nIf you owe $300 and the APR is 22%,\Lyou'll pay about $5.50/month
    in interest.\L\nNever skip a payment. If you do it can\Llower your credit score,
    charge late fees,\Land increase your interest rate.\L\nMaking consistent credit
    card payments\Lcan improve your credit rating."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
